BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Intentional Celebration: Holiday Edition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTSTAMP:20261013T174734Z
UID:6f484250684bf2271dde2a31e276@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Intentional Celebration: Holiday Edition is a two-day indo
 or holiday market and immersive Christmas experience taking place December
  5&#8211\;6\, 2026\, at the WaterFire Arts Center in Providence\, Rhode Is
 land. Free admission from 12&#8211\;5pm both days\, with a paid VIP Hour f
 rom 11am&#8211\;12pm. Beyond traditional holiday shopping\, guests can ste
 p inside festive installations\, join hands-on workshops\, and watch live 
 demonstrations covering holiday decorating\, tablescapes\, floral design\,
  entertaining\, and celebration planning. Instead of simply admiring a dec
 orated tree or a beautifully set table\, attendees can meet the designers 
 and makers behind them and learn how to recreate the ideas at home. The we
 ekend also brings a curated marketplace of local makers and small business
 es\, food trucks\, holiday music\, creative stations for kids\, and a visi
 t from Santa — making it a full day out for families as well as hosts\, 
 DIYers\, and anyone planning their own seasonal gatherings. Shop\, create
 \, learn\, and celebrate the season all in one place. Free admission · Pa
 id VIP Hour tickets on sale now at https://planfuleventkits.com/events Wat
 erFire Arts Center · Providence\, Rhode Island · Free off-street parking
  available\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/the-intention
 al-celebration%3a-holiday-edition/111943/
LOCATION:WaterFire Arts Center\, 475 Valley Street Providence\, RI 02908\,
  Providence\, 02908
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/the-intentional-celebration%3a-
 holiday-edition/111943/
END:VEVENT
